{"id":"vod_bf_15739","vodId":"15739","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"加速世界","name_cn":"加速世界","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/05adeefd8062e68c97a167e9947372bb.jpg"},"summary":"现代社会之中，校园欺凌事件屡禁不止，成为学校和社会的难题。身材肥胖个性内向的有田春雪（梶裕贵 配音）便是长期欺凌的受害者。性格懦弱的春雪无法反抗欺凌者，唯有躲在网络之后，靠玩躲避球游戏来发泄愤怒。一来二去之间，春雪竟然成为了校园内躲避球游戏得分第一位。　　有着“黑雪公主”之称的学生会副会长黑雪姬（三泽纱千香 配音）出现在了春日的面前，黑雪姬不仅制止了对于春雪的欺凌，更邀请他进入了名为“Brain Buster”的方程式，在其中，春日化身成为拥有千倍思考速度的超频连线者，被卷入了激烈的战斗之中。黑雪姬召集春日等人的目的只有一个，那就是重组昔日“黑之王”的军团。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:21:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiasushijie/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com